{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":100,"mirrow":false,"y":-304,"img":"chara051_1","addImg":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1b"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"timeBak":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":0,"scaleY":1,"nonStandBright":false,"x":100,"mirrow":false,"y":-304,"img":"chara051_1","addImg":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1b"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]您不必担心，我在这里居住得十分舒适！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]这么棒的环境，真想让村子中的孩子们也来体验一下。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]不过……突然带小孩子过来，一定会对你们造成困扰吧……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]孩子们总是吵吵闹闹的，要不是对孩子极有包容，还是挺难耐心忍受的。这也是因为孩子们有着最旺盛、最纯净的生命力。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]终有一天，他们也会像为他们付出的万物一般，为了他人、为了未来奉献自己的这份活力。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]而在他们成长到能够为他人奉献的年龄之前，我能不能守护好他们呢……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1h"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]咦？您说，您也会和我一起照顾孩子的，所以不用担心？[r][l]噗。这话……还真有点令人难为情呢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":100,"mirrow":false,"y":-304,"img":"chara051_1","addImg":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1b"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]我知道您不是那个意思啦。我向您保证，不会打扰大家太久的。嗯，等到了那个时候，我们就一起照顾孩子们吧。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":100,"mirrow":false,"y":-304,"img":"chara051_1","addImg":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1b"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"阿莱克西娅-在这里住的还舒服吗？","script":"sj_051_02"}